# Keeps this directory in a fresh clone. Contents are runtime-generated by the
# w34Highcharts weewx report (temp_week.json, wind_week.json, etc.) and gitignored.
# If this dir is missing, weewx's CheetahGenerator throws FileNotFoundError every
# archive cycle (systemd forwards it to the console) and popup charts stay frozen.
# Deploy perms: www-data:www-data, mode 2775.
